  "notes": [
    "1+ Infantry Brigades: 1-2 Infantry Regiments (1-2 Musketeer battalions and 0-1 Fusilier battalion each), plus Brigade Support (Jäger battalion, or a Dragoon/Hussar regiment per army) and Artillery Support (1 Foot battery if 6+ battalions taken).",
    "Army Artillery: up to 1 Heavy battery (if 3 brigades taken), up to 2 Foot batteries (1 per 2 brigades), up to 1 Horse battery (if 3 brigades taken). A brigade can carry no more than 2 batteries.",
    "Up to 2 Cavalry Brigades (1 per Infantry Brigade in the army): 2-4 choices of up to 2 Dragoon regiments, up to 2 Hussar regiments, up to 1 Horse Artillery battery.",
    "Allies: a Late Prussian army can take 25% allies from any one allied list."
  ]
